nd in, and the year, and raises him as his own.","tagline":"An epic story of a man who could do anything... except be ordinary"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8rttNpb83qdHFMPMgFlcspVGaio.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muSeX7fnNw0pv4zHK7RSwZln6Hk.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
